<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Vienna Guide: 12 places – coffee house, Naschmarkt, Schönbrunn &amp; Heuriger – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vienna/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>2. Naschmarkt</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come on Saturday for market and flea market together, but early. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vienna/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>16.36262,48.19818,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. St Stephen’s Cathedral</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Climb the tower early in the morning, then the view is clear and the queue short. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vienna/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>16.37313,48.20849,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Schönbrunn Palace &amp; Gloriette</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Reserve the ticket online and visit the park in the late afternoon. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vienna/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>16.31157,48.18499,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Hofburg &amp; Spanish Riding School</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Book tickets early and plan half a day. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vienna/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>16.3662,48.20768,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Belvedere – Klimt’s “The Kiss”</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come early in the morning before the rush. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vienna/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>16.3804,48.19392,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Prater &amp; Giant Ferris Wheel</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Ride at sunset, then the city glows. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vienna/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>16.39591,48.21674,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Heuriger in Grinzing, Nussdorf &amp; Neustift</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Go in the late afternoon, stay until sunset and take the tram back. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vienna/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>16.3621,48.25895,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Hundertwasser House &amp; Kunst Haus Wien</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Come in the morning for photos without crowds. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vienna/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>16.39387,48.2074,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Sachertorte, schnitzel &amp; co.</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Eat the schnitzel in a Beisl off the main streets. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vienna/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>16.36721,48.20861,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
